  "bio": "Red Elk Tattoo is renowned for their exceptional proficiency in the traditional style of tattooing, having honed their craft to a remarkable degree of artistic excellence. Operating out of SouthShoresFinest in Abington, MA, their work is demonstrative of an unwavering commitment to professionalism, ensuring that every client's experience is as brilliant as the tattoos they create. Their name is frequently associated with quality and meticulous attention to detail, making Red Elk Tattoo a distinguished destination for tattoo connoisseurs.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Abington, Massachusetts, United States\n\nSouthShoresFinest\n1035 Bedford St. Abington,MA.\n@fredecugno\n@jeff_hardiman_tattoo\n@russtownsendtattoo\n@fakelegfoxtattoo\n@cavallo.tattoo\n@erineinhorn",
